OL,3,GNEWSACity's Roman Catholic church
OL,4,Aplaced on at-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Roman Catholic church in Cambridge
OL,7,Fthat recently underwent a #1m
OL,8,Frestoration has been added to Historic
OL,9,FEngland's Heritage at Risk Register.
OL,11,FThe Grade I listed Church of Our Lady
OL,12,Fof the Assumption and the English
OL,13,FMartyrs, on Hills Road, was added to
OL,14,Fthe list after concerns about the
OL,15,Fcondition of its historical fabric and
OL,16,Fcarved stonework.
OL,18,FThe Roman Catholic Diocese of East
OL,19,FAnglia said in 2025-26 the building's
OL,20,Fspire and south aisle underwent
OL,21,Frepairs.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
