OL,3,GNEWSACity's Roman Catholic church
OL,4,Aplaced on at-risk list
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Champion, its diocesan heritage
OL,7,Fofficer, said: "Being put on the
OL,8,FHeritage at Risk Register is an
OL,9,Fopportunity to concentrate and
OL,10,Fprioritise on what needs to be done to
OL,11,Fensure the building's future."
